{"at": "2026-10-11T16:32:26.137964+00:00", "event": "policy_audit", "approved": false, "issues": ["The shared reply_kind and reply_context extraction fields have incompatible enum sets across nodes. evaluate also clears registered enums to undeclared empty strings, including reply_ready. Rejected clearing can retain ready or an old answer across result-only re-entry.", "Caller-first wrong-number, deceased and third-party replies can bypass the required opening. Identity speech does not explicitly enumerate all permitted security questions, and computed instructions are not sufficiently authoritative over entry speech and conversation history.", "Collection questions classified as ai, scam, other_question or answer without an actual proposal can repeat the previous offer indefinitely without advancing the source-defined non-answer budget.", "The initial too_much branch offers a floor payment today instead of starting product negotiation at attempt 1 as Brief B requires.", "Date clarification loses the original amount, common-product scope and relative-period context. For example, a common next-week proposal followed by Friday is not resolved from that context. An ambiguous product reference also discards its accompanying proposal.", "Ordinary references such as my card and the credit card fail entity resolution. During a joint read-back, an unscoped correction can silently change only the last product.", "A read-back date correction can restore an earlier offered amount instead of preserving the pending amount. A late-date adjustment can offer an invalid amount; accepting that offer reaches the write gate with invalid terms.", "Rejecting a read-back does not mark its terms rejected, allowing an already refused offer to be repeated. Hardship paths can call reject and then persuade, contrary to Brief A rule 32.", "The month-swapped retry discards the customer's previously supplied day and year, so a reply containing only the requested month cannot complete the clarification.", "When the last product is marked paid, its required one-business-day explanation is discarded because prefix is not carried into final resolution.", "A post-hook exception can leave verifying, loading or recording active. evaluate then repeats the action, including a potentially successful promise write whose result could not be processed.", "The supplied checks largely exercise isolated hooks and prescribed state. This audit is static; neither those checks nor the proposed checks establish that live extraction, routing or speech has passed."]}
